  "description": "Every time she thinks she found true love, no luck, the guy is gay! Seongha hoped that this would change when she got to college and that she would finally find true love. Don't dream. It's a real curse, this thing. The pattern has been repeating itself since her very first love: either they are gay or they become gay along the way. All her exes? Gay. Her best friend? Gay. At this rate, she has literally zero chance of closing the deal, condemned to the friendzone forever...",
